# AltitudeBank

AltitudeBank is a custom Minecraft banking plugin developed for the Altitude SMP server.  
The plugin provides an in-game banking system with secure balance management, deposit and withdrawal utilities, and economy-related gameplay features.

---

## Features

- Player balance management
- Deposit system
- Withdrawal system
- Half-balance quick transactions
- Custom amount transactions
- Full balance deposit/withdraw support
- Command auto-completion
- User-friendly command handling
- Modular project structure

---

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `/bank` | Opens help menu |
| `/bank balance` | Shows current bank balance |
| `/bank deposit <amount/all>` | Deposits money into bank |
| `/bank deposithalf` | Deposits half of wallet balance |
| `/bank depositcustom` | Deposits custom amount |
| `/bank withdraw <amount/all>` | Withdraws money from bank |
| `/bank withdrawhalf` | Withdraws half of bank balance |
| `/bank withdrawcustom` | Withdraws custom amount |

---

## Tech Stack

- Java
- Maven
- Spigot/Paper API
- Minecraft Plugin Development

---

## Project Structure

```txt
src/main/java/com/altitudebank
├── command
├── listener
├── manager
├── model
├── placeholder
├── task
└── util
```

---

## Installation

1. Build the plugin using Maven
2. Place the generated `.jar` file inside your server's `plugins` folder
3. Restart the server

---

## Development

This project was developed as part of the Altitude SMP ecosystem to improve gameplay experience and server-side economy management.

